==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*gulъ}}, presumably formed from {{m|sla-pro|*-lъ}} and related to {{m|sla-pro|*govorъ}}. Compare semantically analogous {{cog|sva|გულ}}.

